# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope is optional. Example: fix(parser): preserve empty message fields
#
# Separate the optional body from the subject with a blank line.
# Explain the reason for the change and any relevant behavior changes.
#
# For breaking changes, add ! before the colon and describe migration steps
# in the body or a BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
# Reference related issues in a footer, for example: Closes #123
